: "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1041u.jpg"}], "slug": "mass-effect-trilogy", "storyline": "The trilogy is set in a distant future in which humanity has joined a wider galactic community after discovering technology left behind by an ancient, vanished civilization. Playing as Commander Shepard, a soldier in the human military, the player is named the first human agent of an elite galactic order and sent to investigate an attack tied to a rogue operative. The investigation reveals a far larger threat: the Reapers, a race of ancient machines that periodically returns to wipe out advanced life across the galaxy. Across the three games, Shepard assembles a team and works to rally the galaxy's civilizations against this looming danger.", "summary": "Mass Effect Trilogy is a compilation of the first three Mass Effect games, a series of action role-playing games with third-person shooter combat. Players customize a central character, choose a class and abilities, and travel between star systems to explore planets, complete missions, and fight in squad-based encounters. Conversations use a dialogue system in which player choices shape relationships and how parts of the story unfold.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/mass-effect-trilogy", "videos": [{"id": 15985, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "u3q-YzQfkmM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u3q-YzQfkmM", "title": "Mass Effect Trilogy | Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/u3q-YzQfkmM/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 25, "name": "Mass Effect"}]}